  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Growing Resilience and cultivating connections - Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norges Vel operations in Tanzania 2024-2028.
Strengthening of climate resilient food production and producer owned organizations. 
Focus on rice production. Inception phase tilapia production. 

The expected effects for the target group (outcomes) of are:  

1: Increased climate resilient food production and productivity by small-scale food producers. 
2: Female small-scale food producers are empowered. 
3: Sustainable cooperatives and producer owned businesses.   
4: Climate resilient small-scale food producers. 
5: Framework conditions that support small-scale producers and their businesses</narrative>
  </description>
